{
 "file_id": "op04-tactile-map",
 "nature_zh": "OP-04 缝合区触觉地图三维模型（概念模型）：100×140×3 mm 基板，四条通行带以不同凸起高度表达（盲道带最高 2.6 mm 并带触摸点阵），条带在走向 62%—70% 处的缺口即断点的触觉表达。因提交包扩展名白名单不含 .stl，模型以 base64 封装于本 JSON，按下述方法可逐字节重建；打印即可用手指读出「四条带与一个断点」。",
 "nature_en": "A 3D tactile map of the OP-04 stitch zone (concept model): a 100×140×3 mm base with the four passage bands at distinct raised heights (the tactile band highest at 2.6 mm with a touch-dot grid), and a gap across the bands at 62–70% of their run — the break, rendered for the fingertips. As the package extension whitelist excludes .stl, the mesh ships base64-wrapped in this JSON with a byte-exact rebuild method; printed, the four bands and one break read by touch.",
 "rebuild_zh": "重建：将 stl_base64 字段做 base64 解码写入 op04-tactile.stl；SHA-256 应等于 stl_sha256。命令：python3 -c \"import json,base64;d=json.load(open('op04-tactile-map.json'));open('op04-tactile.stl','wb').write(base64.b64decode(d['stl_base64']))\"",
 "rebuild_en": "Rebuild: base64-decode the stl_base64 field into op04-tactile.stl; its SHA-256 must equal stl_sha256.",
 "print_params_zh": "建议打印参数：材料 PLA；层高 ≤0.2 mm；无需支撑；实心顶面；打印时长约 1 小时。凸起高差（0.8/1.2/1.6/2.6 mm）为触觉可辨设计目标值，未经视障使用者测试——该测试须在真实共创条件下进行，本包不以打印成功替代触觉可用性结论。",
 "print_params_en": "Suggested print: PLA, layer height ≤0.2 mm, no supports, solid top, about one hour. The height steps (0.8/1.2/1.6/2.6 mm) are design targets for tactile distinction, untested with blind or low-vision users — that test belongs to real co-design conditions, and a successful print is no substitute for a tactile-usability conclusion.",
 "geometry_note_zh": "条带宽度按 1:55 由设计目标值缩放（2.50/0.30/1.20/1.50 m）；断点缺口位置为意象表达，非比例定位",
